    cap:"Redrawn from Hu et al. (2013), 'changes in power relationships and governance in the last 10 years in China' (after Martens 2006): governance moves from closed state coordination (A) towards more competition (B, market) and participation (C, society). The axes run from closed to open and from power to argumentation.",
