    cap:"Structure of the co-creation committee meetings. Deliberation themes: (1) regeneration planning (latest renovation plans, types of commercial activities, public infrastructure and facilities, style of historic buildings, functions of renovated buildings, self-renovation guideline); (2) problems in construction (noise, building damage, buildings to be demolished, legitimate permits); (3) problems in operation (noise from commercial activities, management of public space such as trash collection, lighting and use of public space).",
